The '''United Alo Protectorate''' or '''UAP''' is a supranational and intergovernmental military and trade confederation of the [[Argommi]]. It is nominally centered on [[Alo]]'s southern continental masses of Osomi and Haklo, however it is in the process of colonizing other planets and moons of its star system.
